  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE BASIC OBJECTIVE OF THE PROGRAM IS SUPPORT AND FINANCE PART OF THE MEASURES FOR THE REFORM AND MODERNIZATION OF THE NATIONAL CUSTOMS SERVICE, WITH THE PURPOSE OF CONTRIBUTING TO INCREASES IN FISCAL REVENUES, IMPROVE THE CIVIL SERVICE AND CONSOLIDATE THE IMPLEMENTATION OF REFORMS IN THE AREA OF EXTERNAL TRADE.</narrative>
